+# Authentication
+
+Set `API_TOKEN` in your environment, then pass it in the Authorization header:
+
+```bash
+curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $API_TOKEN" "$API_URL/v1/items"
+```
+
+Never print the token in logs. To check that it is set, print its length:
+
+```bash
+echo "API_TOKEN has ${#API_TOKEN} characters"
+```
